@page "/instructions"
<div class="instructions-container">
    <h3>How to Play Diagonal Duel</h3>
    <p>
        In each round, a matrix of numbers will appear. Your task is to guess the <strong>absolute
            difference</strong> between:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>The sum of the <span class="text-primary">primary diagonal</span> (top-left to bottom-right)</li>
        <li>And the sum of the <span class="text-success">secondary diagonal</span> (top-right to bottom-left)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        <strong>Scoring:</strong><br />
        Exact match = +2 points<br />
        Close guess (off by 1 or 2) = +1 point<br />
        Too far = 0 points
    </p>
</div>
